1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:02,340
(Amy:)but I'm guessing
still angry?

2
00:00:02,339 --> 00:00:03,709
(Bernadette:)I'm sorry.

3
00:00:03,707 --> 00:00:06,107
(Bernadette:)My boss wants to meet with me,
and I'm stressing.

4
00:00:06,109 --> 00:00:08,679
(Amy:)You really think they're gonna
start treating you differently?

5
00:00:08,678 --> 00:00:10,148
(Bernadette:)Are you kidding?

6
00:00:10,147 --> 00:00:12,077
(Bernadette:)I've always been
treated differently!

7
00:00:12,082 --> 00:00:14,112
Look at me!
Listen to me!

8
00:00:14,117 --> 00:00:16,417
(Bernadette:)I mean, the first thought
when you see me isn't,

9
00:00:16,419 --> 00:00:18,119
"That's a scientist."

10
00:00:18,121 --> 00:00:21,161
It's, "I wonder if her mommy
knows where she is."

11
00:00:23,226 --> 00:00:27,266
(Amy:)I am really regretting
that I got you a Happy Meal.

12
00:00:29,599 --> 00:00:31,699
(Bernadette:)I've worked so hard
to get where I am,

13
00:00:31,701 --> 00:00:34,231
(Bernadette:)and I don't want
to get sent back to square one

14
00:00:34,237 --> 00:00:35,807
(Bernadette:)because I'm pregnant.

15
00:00:35,806 --> 00:00:37,336
(Amy:)I understand how you feel.

16
00:00:37,340 --> 00:00:38,640
(Colonel Williams:)Thank you.

17
00:00:38,661 --> 00:00:39,671
(Amy:)I wish there were

18
00:00:39,676 --> 00:00:41,706
(Amy:)some way I could make it better.

19
00:00:41,711 --> 00:00:44,141
(Bernadette:)Well, you brought me
French fries. That's a start.

20
00:00:44,147 --> 00:00:48,817
(Amy:)Uh, actually, I got you apple
slices 'cause you're pregnant.

21
00:00:49,653 --> 00:00:51,653
(Bernadette:)Apple slices?

22
00:00:51,655 --> 00:00:55,125
(Bernadette:)What kind of lunatic goes
to McDonald's and gets fruit?!

23
00:00:55,125 --> 00:00:57,125
(Amy:)I'll be right back.

24
00:00:57,127 --> 00:01:05,027
And a chocolate shake!

